  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHv/645",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">전부터 가지고 있던 이 전선송<br>파일의 출처를 찾고자&#160;<br>재과만과 유튜브를 열심히 뒤졌는데....<br>출처를 찾지 못했습니다. ㅠㅡㅠ<br>혹, 아시는 분 계시면 출처 표시하겠습니다.<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #000000;\">살짝 옛스럽지만</span><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"> 중후한 남자분 목소리</span>인</b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">깔끔한 가사</span>의 <span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">전선song</span> 입니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>원곡: 금강산 (금강산 찾아가자 일만이천봉~)</b></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5c2vuvkoflxb8a1t57b7cjg@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv6xlbiajcx8xcjg4hcvwuwgw/thumbs/1.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33210355402&amp;signature=WvmQPGKO21%2FqHWTspWZ3WOZpIyk%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv5c2vuvkoflxb8a1t57b7cjg?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NWMydnV2a29mbHhiOGExdDU3YjdjamciLCJ0aWQiOiI1NGJkMzM5Ny0yZTdhLTQ5MTAtODdlNi1kNGE1ZGI2ZTI3MzkiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODYwMTZ9.aYblEWiF1LsXIzJyrQJGuu7_gsD1DC6dQA5JYOmDDGekKLUo0xoduGwlWdODqkYZ1gVWVRHG2pKULCy2Ndpg7w&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6420b460cbf082be4e461f8d224b52ec50876329\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6420b460cbf082be4e461f8d224b52ec50876329\" data-origin-width=\"1167\" data-origin-height=\"820\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35f63555df41591924367dd756e05e88858331d0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35f63555df41591924367dd756e05e88858331d0\" data-origin-width=\"1159\" data-origin-height=\"805\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">음절까지 모두 맞추기 팀게임을 합니다.<br>&#160;<br>개인으로 종이를 주니 팀플이 잘 안되더라구요.<br>&#160;<br>팀으로 B4 2장만 인쇄해서 주니 협동이 좀 더 되네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90874a17d999ae437f754938044f8e28cc5dde4b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90874a17d999ae437f754938044f8e28cc5dde4b\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"540\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;진행순&gt;</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1. 지는 팀 숙제 안내 (음절까지 모두 맞추기. 최후 탈락 2팀은 가사 5번 쓰기)</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2. 규칙 안내 (노래 나올 때는 필기도구 손놓기)</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">3. 종이 주고, 1회 듣기</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">4. 조별 전략 짜고 1회 듣기</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">5. 1절과 2절 끊어듣기 (쉴 때 필기가능)<br>6. 2배속 듣기 연속 2번<br>7. </span></b><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">필기하며 무한 리플레이, 빠르게 통과 팀 보상 등...</span></b><br>&#160;<br>히어링이 아니라 리스닝을 하세요....라며,<br>짧아서 진짜 잘 할 줄 알았는데,<br>들을 때 필기도구가 없으니 생각보다 진행이 매우 느리더라구요.<br>필기하면 좀 더 빠르게 진행가능할 것 같습니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4459293796087d61fd2e720c20510cf2c624d29b?download\" data-file-name=\"전선송_쟁반노래방.hwp\" data-file-size=\"69120\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D645%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220525115004&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4459293796087d61fd2e720c20510cf2c624d29b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">전선송_쟁반노래방</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">67.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
